## Overview

Fuse GDN alpha/beta projections and MMVQ small-batch epilogues. This PR fuses below two paths

1) Fuse the GDN Alpha/Beta producer chain: The kernel uses one block per head, token, and projection, distributes the dot-product reduction across threads. Currently supporting projection weights in BF16, F16, F32, or Q8_0(Q8_0 is dequantized during dot product). 
```
gate = softplus(dot(W_alpha, x) + dt) * ssm_a
beta = sigmoid(dot(W_beta, x))

We fuse the below producer chain in one CUDA launch:

alpha: matrix multiplication -> reshape -> add dt -> softplus -> multiply ssm_a -> reshape
beta:  matrix multiplication -> reshape -> sigmoid
```


